{"id": "EUVD-2025-211138", "enisaUuid": "fc7b06cb-cbfc-3768-9333-b754589768a8", "description": "Raptor RDF Syntax Library from 2.0.15 through 2.0.16 contains a heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability in raptor_new_term_from_counted_literal() caused by truncating language tag length to an unsigned char. Attackers can supply Turtle, TriG, N-Triples or N-Quads documents with language tags of 256 bytes or longer to corrupt heap memory, crash applications, and possibly execute code.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T16:41:49", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/dajobe/raptor/issues/83", "https://github.com/dajobe/raptor/commit/361a803a72817ae771db2438277229e6541e1575", "https://github.com/dajobe/raptor/blob/raptor2_2_0_16/src/raptor_term.c#L200-L218", "https://github.com/dajobe/raptor/blob/raptor2_2_0_16/src/raptor_term.c#L270-L287", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/raptor-rdf-syntax-library-2.0.15-through-2.0.16-heap-buffer-overflow-via-language-tag"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m7mm-cj97-2wxq", "CVE-2025-71436"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.5, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9e777084-28a4-3e53-81f4-5381d3bab7ab", "product": {"name": "Raptor RDF Syntax Library", "vendor": {"name": "librdf"}}, "product_version": "2.0.15 \u22642.0.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "134b7791-ba6b-3fd1-a1eb-772f2722f417", "vendor": {"name": "librdf"}}], "isExploited": false}